    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out this game our friend is making!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/aa8cc5e8f4ccf16321952da0799a8613.avif?t=1729101182\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE ICONIC LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/de527a64b768702258e993868498b1fb.poster.avif?t=1729101182\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/de527a64b768702258e993868498b1fb.webm?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/de527a64b768702258e993868498b1fb.mp4?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use the backrooms slide system to explore all the levels. Find the loot you need, or the stuff that the other scientists need. Do not get cocky and try to be ready to face enemies that backrooms throw at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELP OR <strong>NOT</strong> OTHER SCIENTISTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/c0006442c3bea020b51a828c42680f93.poster.avif?t=1729101182\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/c0006442c3bea020b51a828c42680f93.webm?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/c0006442c3bea020b51a828c42680f93.mp4?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Help out other members of the exploration group, or not. You have multiple choices in every questline (some are very questionable). Help upgrade the poolrooms outpost and unlock new levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT LEGENDARY BACKROOMS ENTITIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/9fe11d01b567ce470fbada5db87a27be.poster.avif?t=1729101182\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/9fe11d01b567ce470fbada5db87a27be.webm?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/9fe11d01b567ce470fbada5db87a27be.mp4?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Complete the main questline, and fight legendary Backrooms entities. Get better, gear up, visit the trader and get the loot you need. If you try hard enough you may be the one to win your life back from the backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE ICONIC LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/de527a64b768702258e993868498b1fb.poster.avif?t=1729101182\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/de527a64b768702258e993868498b1fb.webm?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/de527a64b768702258e993868498b1fb.mp4?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use the backrooms slide system to explore all the levels. Find the loot you need, or the stuff that the other scientists need. Do not get cocky and try to be ready to face enemies that backrooms throw at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HELP OR <strong>NOT</strong> OTHER SCIENTISTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/c0006442c3bea020b51a828c42680f93.poster.avif?t=1729101182\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/c0006442c3bea020b51a828c42680f93.webm?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/c0006442c3bea020b51a828c42680f93.mp4?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Help out other members of the exploration group, or not. You have multiple choices in every questline (some are very questionable). Help upgrade the poolrooms outpost and unlock new levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT LEGENDARY BACKROOMS ENTITIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/9fe11d01b567ce470fbada5db87a27be.poster.avif?t=1729101182\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/9fe11d01b567ce470fbada5db87a27be.webm?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294280/extras/9fe11d01b567ce470fbada5db87a27be.mp4?t=1729101182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Complete the main questline, and fight legendary Backrooms entities. Get better, gear up, visit the trader and get the loot you need. If you try hard enough you may be the one to win your life back from the backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Backrooms Cycle is an immersive exploration RPG/FPS horror set in the backrooms. You will explore and scavenge, build up your arsenal and gain powerful perks. Decide if you want to rescue fellow scientists, build an outpost in the poolrooms or just care about yourself.",
